<title>RUSSIA: Interros-Oil uses SIDANKO stake as loan collateral.</title>
<headline>Interros-Oil uses SIDANKO stake as loan collateral.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interros-Oil has used a 34 percent stake in Russian oil holding company NK SIDANKO as collateral in a loan from Cyprus-registered Kantupun Holding Company Ltd, a Uneximbank spokesman said on Friday.</p>
<p>Uneximbank is part of a financial industrial group which controls Interros-Oil and SIDANKO units include Chernogorneft, Kondpetroleum  and Varyoganneftegaz.</p>
</text>
